**bind.cpp queues controller bindings and tracks custom layouts.**

## Interface

`controller_command_for(const char*) noexcept -> const char*` maps `+activate`/`+reload`→`+usereload`, `+melee_breath`→`+holdbreath`, preserving other commands and null.

`bind_bridge::bind_bridge(const context&, const dvars&)`; `apply_layout(string_view)`, `apply_configured_layout()`, `migrate_controller_commands()`, `reapply_layout()`, `note_manual_rebind() noexcept`, and `command_keys(int, bool, const char*, int (&)[2]) noexcept -> size_t`.

## Contracts

`apply_layout` uses `mapping::binding_table`/`apply_button_layout`, queues `bind <key> "<command>"\n` through `game::Cbuf_AddText`, and reports binding count via `context::report`.

`custom_layout` is `"custom"`; `apply_configured_layout` skips it, while `note_manual_rebind` writes it through `Dvar_SetString`. `command_keys` sets both outputs to `-1`, returns `0`; `migrate_controller_commands` is empty.